note: a breakpoint hit stops the whole service: its HTTP callers time out, docker's healthcheck turns the container unhealthy after about retries x interval + timeout (shown per service above), and a Kafka consumer leaves its group after max.poll.interval.ms (5 minutes by default). Keep stops short; 'eyedbg compose wait' shows how long each has been stopped.
